{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35441","headline":"三年冬大礼五首 四 · 曹唐","name":"三年冬大礼五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山拥飞云海水清，天坛未夕仗先成。\n千官不起金縢议，万国空瞻玉藻声。\n禁火曙然烟焰褭，宫衣寒拂雪花轻。\n侧闻左右皆周吕，看取从容致太平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35441.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35441","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}